msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to find the maximum independent set of a graph using the [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), a constrained combinatorial optimization problem.\n"
"An instance from the QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) benchmark library is formulated as a binary linear program and passed to the Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"The optimizer handles all reformulation, circuit synthesis, transpilation, and iterative warm starting internally (see [\\[3\\]](#references) for details).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini mendemonstrasikan cara menemukan maximum independent set dari sebuah graf menggunakan [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), sebuah masalah optimisasi kombinatorial berkendala.\n"
"Sebuah instance dari pustaka benchmark QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) diformulasikan sebagai program linear biner dan diteruskan ke Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"Optimizer menangani semua reformulasi, sintesis sirkuit, transpilasi, dan iterative warm starting secara internal (lihat [\\[3\\]](#references) untuk detailnya).\n"

